cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use apeGmsh in your research, please cite it as below."
title: apeGmsh
abstract: >-
  A structural-FEM wrapper around Gmsh with a composition-based API and a
  snapshot FEM broker. Loads, masses, and constraints are declared against
  labels before a mesh exists and resolved once against the generated mesh,
  yielding a frozen FEMData snapshot that serves as the single contract
  between Gmsh and any downstream solver. OpenSees is supported as the
  reference binding.
type: software
